<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch economic indicators March 3-7.</title>
<headline>Dutch economic indicators March 3-7.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said it planned to publish the following key Dutch economic indicators next week.</p>
<p>GMT---date--indicator------------period----previous</p>
<p> 0830  3/3   Trade balance	  Oct/Nov   +3.8 bln NLG (Sept)</p>
<p> 0830  5/3   EU harmonised CPI    (explanatory statement)</p>
<p> 0930  7/3   CPI (domestic)	 Feb	 2.3 pct yr/yr</p>
<p> 1300  7/3   EU harmonised CPI    Feb	 ---</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
